::: {.callout-note icon=false}

1. Select the **design type** (Mixed, Between-Between, or Within-Within ANOVA).
2. Indicate whether the **interaction was significant** in your SPSS output.
3. If the interaction was not significant, select the significance status of each **main effect**.
4. Specify the **number of levels** for each factor if you want tailored pairwise comparison guidance.
5. Click **Show decision path** to generate your interpretation steps and APA-style reporting examples.

This tool is companion to [Appendix @sec-appendix-spss-factorial-anova] (SPSS Tutorial: Factorial ANOVA).
:::

```{=html}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f6f8fb;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --text: #1f2937;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --line: #dbe3ee;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --accent-soft: #dbeafe;
      --good: #166534;
      --good-bg: #dcfce7;
      --warn: #92400e;
      --warn-bg: #fef3c7;
      --shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      --radius: 18px;
    }

    .fadt-wrap * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    .fadt-wrap {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0 0 24px 0;
    }

    .fadt-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .fadt-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .fadt-card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .fadt-section-title {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .fadt-wrap label {
      display: block;
      margin: 14px 0 5px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .fadt-wrap select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .fadt-btn-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; }

    .fadt-wrap button {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.15s, transform 0.1s;
    }
    .fadt-wrap button:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
    .fadt-wrap button:active { transform: translateY(1px); }

    .fadt-run-btn  { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
    .fadt-reset-btn { background: #475569; color: #fff; }

    .fadt-helper {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .fadt-output { display: grid; gap: 16px; }

    .fadt-pill-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .fadt-pill {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .fadt-banner {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .fadt-banner.good { background: var(--good-bg); color: var(--good); border-color: #bbf7d0; }
    .fadt-banner.warn { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn); border-color: #fde68a; }

    .fadt-tree {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #fbfdff;
